Package: caribou-wallet
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: The Caribou Developers <briantstafford@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Description: Non-custodial, multi-chain wallet
 Caribou is a self-custodial cryptocurrency wallet for Bitcoin, Ethereum,
 Monero and other chains, with built-in swaps. This package installs the
 desktop application, caribou-desktop.
